/span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_Mother%27s_Loathing\" title=\"A Mother's Loathing\">A Mother's Loathing</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Cannot be used on <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Plant\" title=\"Plant\">Plant</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental\" title=\"Elemental\">Elemental</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ooze\" title=\"Ooze\">Ooze</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Construct\" title=\"Construct\">Construct</a> creature types.</li>\n<li>Cannot be used on creatures that are <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Petrified\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Petrified_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Petrified_(Condition)\" title=\"Petrified (Condition)\">Petrified</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715040301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.080 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3158/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47412/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14991/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnst